			"notes": "-Skeletons' bows now have limited durability, which increases when the first nether portal is constructed, and when the first wither is summoned.\n\nNote:\n0.2.2-fix fixed an issue where mobs don't spawn at all on servers. This was caused by the feature that mobs tend to spawn in groups after end portal activation. I couldn't figure out the cause, at the moment the feature is removed.\n0.2.2-ffiixx fixed an issue where the game sometimes crashes due to mob spawner spinning entities having null as worldobj."
